                            name: "index.threads",
                            description: Some("Specifies the number of threads to spawn when loading the index. This is meant to reduce index load time on multiprocessor machines. Specifying 0 or 'true' will cause Git to auto-detect the number of CPU's and set the number of threads accordingly. Specifying 1 or 'false' will disable multithreading. Defaults to 'true'"),
